  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">안녕하세요</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">학생들이 소화, 순환, 호흡, 배설 부분을 외울게 너무 많아 어려워하고, 흥미도 떨어지는 것 같아 </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">고민하던 중에 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">최근 김정식 수석님의 연수를 통해 접하게된 수업 아이디어(<a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/483011\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/483011</a>)에서 영감을 받아</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">Ai(Suno)를 활용하여 수업송(소화, 순환, 호흡, 배설)과 학습지를 직접 만들어보았습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">(Ai의 작곡 능력이 매우 우수하더라구요... 가사만 직접 만들었습니다.)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">한 예능 프로그램의 받쓰 형식으로 복습하도록 하니까 학생들 호응이 정말 좋더라구요</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">활용해보시면 좋을 것 같아 공유 드립니다.&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c3174a26a4019691ed4a68ee9fb697f7c893523?download\" data-file-name=\"[과학송]소화,순환,호흡,배설-학습지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"257024\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1354%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20250922112519&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6c3174a26a4019691ed4a68ee9fb697f7c893523')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[과학송]소화,순환,호흡,배설-학습지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">251.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/91555241a6db01ab857820dbcd650755b4ba5352\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/91555241a6db01ab857820dbcd650755b4ba5352\" data-origin-width=\"1148\" data-origin-height=\"812\"><div class=\"figcaption\">요런식으로 학습지를 만들었습니다.</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">영상은 학습지에 QR코드로 링크 첨부해두었고,</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">혹시 음원 파일로 필요하신 분이 계시다면 아래에서 직접 다운받으실 수 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">(소화과정)</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\"> <a href=\"https://suno.com/s/9qxRhZ7EncLAFc1b\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://suno.com/s/9qxRhZ7EncLAFc1b</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cd03398863065227cd465a36d67ab037cac204ef?download\" data-file-name=\"[과학송] 소화과정.mp3\" data-file-size=\"2266432\" data-mimetype=\"audio/mpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1354%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20250922112519&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fcd03398863065227cd465a36d67ab037cac204ef')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[과학송] 소화과정</span><span class=\"type\">.mp3</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.16MB</div></div></a></div><p><br>(순환) <a href=\"https://suno.com/s/HDrQ9cLPBE9Tc2JB\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://suno.com/s/HDrQ9cLPBE9Tc2JB</a></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83a945a29237bae6a01b6bbb443a1b719b7965a4?download\" data-file-name=\"[과학송] 순환.mp3\" data-file-size=\"2575960\" data-mimetype=\"audio/mpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1354%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20250922112519&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F83a945a29237bae6a01b6bbb443a1b719b7965a4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[과학송] 순환</span><span class=\"type\">.mp3</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.46MB</div></div></a></div><p>(호흡) <a href=\"https://suno.com/s/HDrQ9cLPBE9Tc2JB\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://suno.com/s/HDrQ9cLPBE9Tc2JB</a></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/41a0ac3180ba849efe7ad7ef339d4d6c71eff4e8?download\" data-file-name=\"[과학송] 호흡.mp3\" data-file-size=\"1832295\" data-mimetype=\"audio/mpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1354%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20250922112519&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F41a0ac3180ba849efe7ad7ef339d4d6c71eff4e8')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[과학송] 호흡</span><span class=\"type\">.mp3</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.75MB</div></div></a></div><p>(배설) <a href=\"https://suno.com/s/D9Ruiq95NyO75EON\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://suno.com/s/D9Ruiq95NyO75EON</a></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bd034ac48ba4f31cbc0e89d0207c3b9b7b19effe?download\" data-file-name=\"[과학송] 배설.mp3\" data-file-size=\"2184157\" data-mimetype=\"audio/mpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1354%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20250922112519&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fbd034ac48ba4f31cbc0e89d0207c3b9b7b19effe')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[과학송] 배설</span><span class=\"type\">.mp3</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.08MB</div></div></a></div><p>감사합니다~</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
